#: src/PaymentMethods.php:194
msgid "Payment methods that set an order to \"Processing\" before the money arrived (default: cash on delivery, bank transfer, cheque; add e.g. invoice or pay at pickup). Vouchers of such orders are issued only once the payment is confirmed: the order is completed, the payment is recorded, or a paid status is set by hand."
